 ## 2026-09-23
 
+### TASK-260830-nxqqaw — RPC 2 namespace roots and bounded inventory exchange
+
+- IMPLEMENTATION: `internal/merkleinventory` adds deterministic Section 11.4 roots/children, schema-owned membership, bounded `inventory.roots` / `inventory.children` / `objects.get`, and in-process differing-node retrieval. All package wire JSON now enters one exact strict decoder; an AST guard blocks aliased `encoding/json` bypasses. RPC envelopes still use `internal/rpcwire`. Section 10.7 Tombstone and Acknowledgement identity validation admits their complete closed shapes; acknowledgement admission requires its stored Tombstone and matching subject. No Host Channel handler or capability advertisement was added.
+- CONFORMANCE: the production trie reproduces empty/singleton/branch fixtures, child hashes and all six MIXED-NS-1 roots. N1 pins the valid six-root fixture, models Descriptor-as-record / independent Chunk / local-marker membership, and demonstrates root divergence only in `record`, `manifest`, and `blob`. MIXED-NS-EXCHANGE has separate exact synthetic-ID identity-level and validated real-byte proofs. Four mapped schema rows remain fail-closed, each with a literal refusal test, unchanged roots/counts, no quarantine, and a row-specific admitting narrowing. The 10-site wire-decoder census and exhaustive wrong-kind/casefold/missing/extra/duplicate tests are recorded in `internal/merkleinventory/CONFORMANCE-MATRIX.md`; producer property coverage is 4 of 4 rows driven. Lease-head/divergent-event rules remain with the Story union owner.
+- MUTATIONS: the final 49-row harness run produced 47 ordinary isolated kills, one token-preserving behavioral bypass kill (source census passed), and one applied neutral-comment survivor control. Its raw overlays and test logs are under `.temp/TASK-260830-nxqqaw/validation/rev3/mutations-full-final/`; the explicit `client-two-wireobjects` test-alone probe also killed its narrowing.
+- IMPORTER OUTCOMES: base checkpoint `0ca3e4c26e2b275212796657f785b9b450f6174e` and rev3 candidate have 44 → 45 package paths. Direct importer sets are `canonicaljson` 22 → 23, `rpcwire` 3 → 4, and `provhost` 5 → 5; `merkleinventory` is the only new direct importer of the first two packages, and no `rpcwire` production validator changed. Serialized importer runs passed 26/26 base packages (21,792 passing test events, 14 skipped) and 27/27 candidate packages (22,854 passing test events, 14 skipped). No rev3 runtime class moved beyond Tombstone and Tombstone Acknowledgement admission under §10.7. The complete `(package, entry, input)` comparison is in `internal/merkleinventory/IMPORTER-OUTCOMES.md`.
+- VALIDATION: formatting, native and Windows vet, native/Linux/Windows builds, the full verbose suite, coverage suite, all six race groups, 17 fuzz targets, tracecheck, catalog check, JSON syntax and diff check exited 0. `go test ./internal/merkleinventory -count=3`, the full mutation harness, and both importer grids exited 0. `task-board validate` exited 0, with 174 `[MISSING_ACTIVITY]` warnings and 256 board issues elsewhere; none named this Story or task, and 3279/3279 ledger rows were mirrored. Raw task-scoped logs are under `.temp/TASK-260830-nxqqaw/validation/rev3/`.
+- DELIVERY: candidate remains UNCOMMITTED in the managed Story worktree. No shared traceability registry row was edited; the Story final leaf owns that update.
+
 ### TASK-260922-31qyyi — derivation-side profile source authority (story-final)
 
 - REPRODUCTION: on base `c9233ce2b7d98b70707cb3aec28f919d53a4c020`, the accepted instrumented probe-15 evidence disables `sessrepo.checkWinningLease`; `Projector.Project` still returned `{Profile:yolo, HasSource:true}`. Raw source event and output are in `.temp/TASK-260922-31qyyi/reproduction/`. This baseline evidence was accepted from the earlier attached artifact and was not rerun during final validation.
